<h2 class="bde-heading-506-115 bde-heading">
How Much Are the Nets Paying Egor Dëmin in 2026-27?
</h2><div class="bde-fancy-container-506-116 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-fancy-container-506-139 bde-fancy-container">
  
  
	



<div class="bde-f-text-506-151 bde-f-text">
<p>Dëmin earns <strong>$7.23m</strong> in 2026-27, up from <strong>$6.89m</strong> as a rookie. He’s eighth on the <a href="/teams/brooklyn-nets/">Brooklyn</a> payroll, just below <a href="/players/mikel-brown-jr/">Mikel Brown Jr.</a>, who was drafted two slots higher a year later.</p>
<p>His career earnings come to <strong>$14.12m</strong> across two seasons. The salary is <strong>4.52%</strong> of Brooklyn’s <strong>$160.06m</strong> payroll.</p>

