<div class="bde-f-text-506-154 bde-f-text">
<p>Dëmin signed his rookie contract on July 3, 2025, four years and <strong>$31.34m</strong> with <strong>$14.12m</strong> guaranteed. The third and fourth seasons are club options.</p>
<p>Eighth pick money comes off the rookie scale. The first option falls due on November 2, 2026, so the decision on his third season is already close.</p>

