</div>
</div><div class="bde-f-text-506-156 bde-f-text">
<p>Dëmin’s net worth is estimated at around <strong>$5.6m</strong>, derived from his <strong>$14.12m</strong> in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for a player in his second season.</p>
<p>He came from Russia and spent a season at Brigham Young before the draft, having played in Spain as a teenager before that. Earnings from European basketball sit outside the NBA record and aren’t counted here.</p>

