<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/egor-demin/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/egor-demin/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Are the Nets Paying Egor Dëmin in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dëmin earns $7.23m in 2026-27, up from $6.89m as a rookie. He’s eighth on the Brooklyn payroll, just below Mikel Brown Jr., who was drafted two slots higher a year later. His career earnings come to $14.12m across two seasons. The salary is 4.52% of Brooklyn’s $160.06m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Egor Dëmin Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The club option on 2027-28 has a deadline of November 2, 2026, so his third season is decided within days. Exercising both options takes him to restricted free agency in 2029 at 23, which is unusually early to be negotiating a second contract."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Egor Dëmin Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $7.23m season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Long Is Egor Dëmin’s Contract With the Nets?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dëmin signed his rookie contract on July 3, 2025, four years and $31.34m with $14.12m guaranteed. The third and fourth seasons are club options. Eighth pick money comes off the rookie scale. The first option falls due on November 2, 2026, so the decision on his third season is already close."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Egor Dëmin’s Estimated Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dëmin’s net worth is estimated at around $5.6m, derived from his $14.12m in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for a player in his second season. He came from Russia and spent a season at Brigham Young before the draft, having played in Spain as a teenager before that. Earnings from European basketball sit outside the NBA record and aren’t counted here."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Egor Dëmin on a Rookie Contract?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Dëmin is paid $7.23m because he was the eighth pick in 2025, and nothing he does for four years will change it. He’ll be 22 if the contract runs its full length, which is young for a player entering restricted free agency."}}]}</script>
